THE PIANO
Salamander Grand Piano V3 (2016-12-09), a Yamaha C5,
by Alexander Holm.
Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 (CC BY 3.0),
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/
Source: https://freepats.zenvoid.org/Piano/
SalamanderGrandPiano/
SalamanderGrandPianoV3+20161209_44khz16bit.tar.xz
Changed for this disk: 8 of the 16 velocity layers and one
sample every three semitones, kept at 16 bits, resampled,
cut to a recorded attack plus a short crossfaded loop, and
set to new levels, with each sample's original level kept
for the player, which mixes 16 voices in software.

